'''Esoteric Uril''' (ネコ神面のウリル, ''Neko Shinmen no Uriru'', '''Divine Cat Mask Uril''' or '''Cat God-Mask Uril''') is a [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] variant of [[Master Uril (Enemy)|Master Uril]] introduced on [[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|Floor 50]] of the [[Infernal Tower]], which unlocks him as [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Master Uril]]'s [[True Form]] via [[Catnip Challenges]] when completed. He was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Esoteric Uril
|image = E 674.png
|appearance = [[Infernal Tower/Floor 50|Infernal Tower - Floor 50]]
|money drop = 3,333¢ - 13,165¢
}}

==Enemy==
This Relic variant of Uril has two more knockbacks, but boasts even higher overall stats. He does more damage and has more health, with a higher standing range of 300 and an Omni Strike that hits up to 550. His rapid, devastating attacks generate level 4 [[Surge Attack]]s on hit that reach almost as far. Though he retains his Curse ability and has a 50% chance to Slow [[Cat Units]], these are largely irrelevant in face of his sheer strength that shreds them with terrifying ease.

