==Trivia==
*Esoteric Uril has the second-highest health of all [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]], right behind [[Sage of Life Dr. Nova]].
*He, [[Masked Grandmaster Cat (Enemy)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]], and [[Spiritual Yulala (Enemy)|Spiritual Yulala]] are currently the only Relic Enemies without descriptions, unlike their Traitless variants fought in Heavenly Tower.
**Incidentally, all of these enemies are exclusive to the [[Infernal Tower]] and fought to unlock the [[True Form]]s of their corresponding [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]].

